s i tonun r\u00c7n\u00d3 thavvim\u2019m\u00e7 eznaun"}]},{"blockId":"block.e5199e24374141a5812062c1d92df6e6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.37","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Elen gur tonun r\u00c7n\u00d3 thavvim\u2019m\u00e7 eznaun z\u00dfgu\u00d9owya. T\u00d7 elen ton neksus gl\u00c9stvoren po\u2019ezna gl\u00c9stowya. Ni h\u00eb\u00d5 i govis tonun ni nor\u00d3a kojowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.baa92f1beb924bd6846f191728e0e264","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.174","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vin \u00d3\u00c5tus tonun thavvim\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7owya, w\u00cf\u00dfe \u00d1etib giktenv\u00d7s\u00dflum gl\u00c9st\u2019en \u00c9lmowya. Ni lilthrenin, ni h\u00c5b\u00cdtorpgur, \u00e3\u00d1 gren y\u00eblyemar vesna\u2019m\u00e7 tonun memil\u2019jw\u00ebnowya. Neksus ton ni grafvesna gurun koj\u2019jw\u00ebnowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d0ad61d47ffe43678fc5b2ec1fc46d12","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.375","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 tonun gurin vesna tonun kojowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.ac25bd016cae4553aeca660ea351f79d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.416","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben i tonun ni nor\u00d3a \u00b7 4\u00c1"}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":36,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":37,"end":173,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":174,"end":374,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":375,"end":415,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"